  "Title": "献给美丽女神的七重奏",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 1050112001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｄ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是银河座的公演呢。/n应该能看到一场稳定扎实的舞台。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "2220",
      "BgmFileName": "5",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｅ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "今年的银河座，突然展现出了不少变化。/n这会带来怎样的结果……值得一看。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｆ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……要开始了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "BgmFileName": "205",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「我明白了。既然是为了阿佛洛狄忒大人。/n　我喀戎必定会将金羊的皮毛献到您面前。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「……怎么会这样。我太能理解这只羊的心情了。/n　谁都不愿意成为被狩猎的一方。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「看到它哭成这样，我怎么可能拉开这张弓！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "评审们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "観客",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（这样的演技……让看着的人都不由自主地跟着投入感情……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「喂，金羊。你听说过卡尔基诺斯吗？/n　那是一只曾勇敢迎战赫拉克勒斯的英勇螃蟹。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「他有一对非常漂亮的钳子。/n　如今已经升上夜空，化作了闪耀的星辰——」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「听说正因为成了星星，他的钳子无需杀死猎物，/n　也能把皮毛漂亮地剪下来。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「只要借到卡尔基诺斯的钳子，/n　或许就能在不伤害你的情况下，只取下金色羊毛。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「好了，我们去找卡尔基诺斯吧！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "劇団関係者",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（高水准的演技和身段。这就是银河座……！/n　就算千寿历不在，也能呈现出这种等级的舞台！？）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｄ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（一如近年的稳定舞台……可是，/n　「色彩」不同了。每一位演员的动作都……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｅ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（以座长拉莫娜·沃尔芙为中心，/n　其他演员也随之行动着。仿佛彼此支撑一般……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｆ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……这不是相当有意思吗。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「你们是什么人？找我有什么事？」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「卡尔基诺斯，我们有一事相求。/n　能否请你把那把钳子借给我们？」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「……嗯。看来你们有自己的难处。/n　不过，这把钳子可不是能随随便便借给别人的东西。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「可要我眼睁睁看着你在这里/n　杀掉这只羊，我心里也不痛快。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「所以，我接下来要睡一觉。/n　在我睡着期间，你们拿这把钳子做什么都随你们。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「但只限我睡这一觉的时间，明白了吗。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「……！谢谢你，卡尔基诺斯！/n　来吧，金羊……这样就能把你的羊毛剪下来了。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｆ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（担任座长的拉莫娜·沃尔芙……。/n　她不只是在演戏，而是在统领整个舞台……！）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｆ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（难道说，就连其他演员演技中最细微的变化，/n　她也全部掌握了吗……！？否则根本无法解释！）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｅ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（除了沃尔芙之外，其他演员身上也绽放着仿佛在宣告自身存在般的/n　耀眼光芒……这些孩子真是前途无量呢。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｄ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那么，就由我代表评审进行总评。/n……不愧是银河座。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120280",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｄ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "建立在长期积淀的传统之上的扎实演技，非常出色。/n而且，这一次的银河座还有别的地方必须给予肯定。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｄ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你们没有被传统本身束缚，/n反而让我感受到了始终想走在时代最前方的骄傲。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501120300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050112034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050112,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……！非常感谢！",
